<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - PRODUCER PRICE INDEX UP 0.4 PCT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - PRODUCER PRICE INDEX UP 0.4 PCT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's producer price index rose by a month-on-month 0.4 percent in June compared to May's monthly 2.4 percent rise, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p>Compared to June 1996, the index rose by 9.1 percent, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>During the second quarter of 1997, the index rose 3.1 percent compared to the first quarter, including a rise of two percent in manufacturing.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
